Package: graalmail
Version: 0.1.0
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: default-jre (>= 21) | openjdk-21-jre, libgtk-3-0, libxtst6, libxrender1
Maintainer: ObiWindu <Obi.wandu@proton.me>
Description: Mail client for Gmail, Outlook, Yahoo, Proton Mail and IMAP
 GraalMail is a desktop mail client supporting multiple email providers
 including Gmail, Microsoft Outlook/365, Yahoo Mail, Proton Mail (via Bridge),
 and generic IMAP/SMTP servers. It features end-to-end encryption for local
 storage, offline support, and a modern JavaFX-based user interface.
Homepage: https://github.com/graalmail/graalmail